<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ptĭsăna</span></b> , ae,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτισάνη</span> (al.
		tisana). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Barley crushed and cleaned from the hulls</i>, <i>barley-groats</i>, <i>pearl-barley</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 2, 18, 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 12,
				72, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 93</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Prov.
				27, 22</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a drink made from
				barley-groats</i>, <i>barley-water</i>, <i>ptisan</i>, Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non.
				550, 19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 18, 7, 15, §
		74</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
